      "statusChangeID": "631938dd4d29f144b690b0a9",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "available in future release",
      "value": "The current implementation is now available in Open Beta. Please note it is currently only visible in Main Menu avatar stats and not in the Quick Menu. If you have specific feedback or bug reports about this feature please post them to the Open Beta board.\nAlso note the relevant part from the latest Open Beta patch notes for more information:\n - Added avatar texture VRAM usage estimation to the Avatar Stats system\n    - This feature estimates the amount of VRAM in use by a given avatar and displays it. It isn't 100% accurate, but its close!\n    - You might see this value differ from some community-created tools like Thry's VRCAvatarTools. That's because we only list texture VRAM!\n    - This stat does not currently affect Performance Rank, but it will eventually. From our observations, keeping the VRChat value under ~40MB seems like a \"Good\" place to aim for\n    - Will be implemented into the SDK at a later time",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
